WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:15.660
Crap.

00:15.660 --> 00:17.410
That's what they were after.

00:29.370 --> 00:32.380
That was careless of me.

00:33.570 --> 00:36.910
I'll have to come up with another plan.

00:49.460 --> 00:57.720
<b>My Daughter Left the Nest and Returned an S-Rank Adventurer</b>

02:08.350 --> 02:13.690
<b>Episode 4 "Quiet Days in Turnera with the Occasional Family Spat"</b>

02:08.600 --> 02:10.720
Okay, everyone. Get in line.

02:10.720 --> 02:12.970
We'll hand them out one at a time, okay?

02:12.240 --> 02:13.320
Okay!

02:13.320 --> 02:16.160
This hot wine is popular in Orphen.

02:16.160 --> 02:20.010
You add these spices and 
honey and drink it warm.

02:20.010 --> 02:21.150
Hurry up!

02:20.010 --> 02:21.570
Oh, thanks.

02:21.570 --> 02:23.810
Of course! Oh, also...

02:22.540 --> 02:23.810
Thank you!

02:30.070 --> 02:31.850
You've grown so much.

02:32.910 --> 02:35.110
Huh? Where did I put it?

02:36.640 --> 02:38.870
<i>An S-rank tag, huh?</i>

02:39.170 --> 02:43.500
<i>Who would've thought my daughter'd reach
rank S when I ended my career at rank E.</i>

02:45.150 --> 02:46.210
Dad?

02:46.760 --> 02:47.930
What is it?

02:49.570 --> 02:51.410
Oh, it's nothing.

02:54.780 --> 02:57.110
Bonfires and straw...

02:57.110 --> 02:59.660
You smell nice, Dad.

03:01.050 --> 03:03.010
What are you talking about?

03:03.010 --> 03:05.670
Even all grown up, you're still such a baby.

03:05.900 --> 03:09.770
No matter how old I get, 
I'll always be your daughter.

03:12.700 --> 03:14.100
Well, come on in.

03:14.100 --> 03:16.170
Thanks for having us!

03:16.440 --> 03:19.320
I appreciate you coming 
all this way with Ange.

03:19.320 --> 03:21.170
You must be exhausted from the journey.

03:21.170 --> 03:25.480
No, not at all. We enjoyed 
the nice, relaxing trip.

03:25.480 --> 03:29.220
I've never seen Ange get
 so affectionate before.

03:29.630 --> 03:32.480
She must really be a daddy's girl, huh?

03:33.350 --> 03:38.090
Listen, it's been five years! No, almost six!

03:38.090 --> 03:39.840
And I've been so patient! Go me!

03:40.490 --> 03:41.810
All right, all right.

03:41.810 --> 03:45.830
That's enough of that. 
Go put your things away.

03:45.830 --> 03:47.360
Okay!

03:47.360 --> 03:50.510
Ane and Miri, you can put your stuff here.

03:51.140 --> 03:53.830
I hear Ange finally made it home.

03:53.830 --> 03:57.820
Mr. Kerry! I was planning 
to bring some gifts by later.

03:57.820 --> 04:00.710
Wow, you sure have grown!

04:00.710 --> 04:03.310
Are you really shrimpy little Ange?

04:03.550 --> 04:09.370
Aren't you Barnes, the guy who always lost 
sword fights to me despite being older?

04:10.920 --> 04:12.810
You don't have to bring that up...

04:13.120 --> 04:18.060
Say, Kerry, if you've got any spare blankets,
 could I borrow some?

04:18.060 --> 04:21.520
Sure thing. Ange, come by to pick them up.

04:22.590 --> 04:23.820
Okay.

04:27.180 --> 04:31.080
Here. This tea is made from 
lent leaves picked locally.

04:31.080 --> 04:33.240
Sorry the place is a mess.

04:33.240 --> 04:36.570
No, we're sorry for dropping in on you.

04:36.570 --> 04:41.920
Honestly, this is tidier than our place.
 It's kind of embarrassing.

04:41.920 --> 04:45.340
Ane leaves her clothes 
all over the place at home.

04:45.340 --> 04:47.080
You mean <i>you</i> do!

04:47.080 --> 04:50.730
Absolutely not. I would never do that.

04:50.730 --> 04:52.710
No fair, Miri.

04:53.350 --> 04:56.330
Sorry to make a fuss...

04:57.540 --> 04:59.700
You two seem close.

04:59.700 --> 05:01.480
Just like Ange said.

05:01.480 --> 05:02.540
What?

05:02.540 --> 05:04.650
She wrote about you in her letters.

05:04.650 --> 05:07.960
She said Ane was a serious girl,
 while Miri was...

05:09.040 --> 05:11.290
a bit careless but fun.

05:11.290 --> 05:14.240
What? That's not true.

05:14.240 --> 05:16.790
Ange can be pretty careless too, you know.

05:17.920 --> 05:19.740
You might be right about that.

05:19.740 --> 05:23.080
Thank you both for being Ange's friends.

05:24.590 --> 05:29.600
I think you're the reason
 she didn't get lonely in Orphen.

05:29.600 --> 05:30.970
I'm grateful.

05:32.780 --> 05:34.940
Now, drink up while it's hot.

05:35.410 --> 05:37.620
Thanks for the tea!

05:37.620 --> 05:40.360
Come to think of it, on our way here...

05:41.070 --> 05:43.710
My name is Sasha Bordeaux.

05:43.710 --> 05:47.740
Thank you for rescuing 
my younger sister, Seren.

05:48.630 --> 05:50.740
You're Seren's sister?

05:50.740 --> 05:54.110
I am! I met your father, 
Mr. Belgrieve, the other day.

05:55.700 --> 05:59.240
I see. So you're the one...

06:00.100 --> 06:04.500
M-Ms. Angeline, have I done 
something to upset you?

06:05.350 --> 06:07.040
Don't play dumb.

06:07.040 --> 06:10.550
I know you tried to drag 
my father off to Bordeaux.

06:10.550 --> 06:14.550
N-No, that wasn't me. 
That was my older sister.

06:15.830 --> 06:16.770
What?

06:16.770 --> 06:18.810
Okay, break it up.

06:19.910 --> 06:27.290
You see, it was my older sister, Helvetica,
 who made trouble for Mr. Belgrieve.

06:27.290 --> 06:30.930
Don't worry about it.
Our dummy here pestered you, too.

06:30.930 --> 06:32.380
What do we say, Ange?

06:32.820 --> 06:34.340
I'm sorry...

06:34.620 --> 06:37.710
Worry not. 
I'm glad we resolved the misunderstanding.

06:37.950 --> 06:41.710
Anyhoo, I had no idea you studied 
swordsmanship under Ange's dad.

06:41.710 --> 06:46.320
Yes. Ms. Angeline's father,
 Master Belgrieve the Red Ogre,

06:46.320 --> 06:48.350
is a fabulously skilled swordsman.

06:48.350 --> 06:51.290
He's also a talented tactician—

06:52.560 --> 06:55.490
Forgive me for getting the
 wrong idea about you.

06:55.990 --> 06:58.390
I see now that you're just like me.

06:59.380 --> 07:02.010
D-Do you really mean it?

07:02.010 --> 07:05.740
I, Sasha Bordeaux, am truly touched!

07:07.920 --> 07:10.860
I see. So that's what happened...

07:11.170 --> 07:16.490
I'm not sure I have any business instructing
a Double A-rank adventurer, though.

07:17.110 --> 07:21.010
You were an adventurer too, weren't you?

07:21.910 --> 07:26.250
I suppose, but this happened 
to me when I was young.

07:26.770 --> 07:30.470
I was only in the business
 for about three years.

07:30.730 --> 07:35.590
I stopped at rank E too,
which makes you my betters.

07:35.590 --> 07:39.640
Even so, you seem like a really nice guy.

07:39.640 --> 07:44.620
Since they call you the Red Ogre,
I thought you'd be fiercer.

07:45.610 --> 07:49.960
Um, who told you people call me by that name?

07:49.960 --> 07:52.840
Huh? Well, Ange did.

07:52.840 --> 07:53.750
What?

07:54.620 --> 07:59.470
Hey, don't flirt with my dad without 
discussing it with me first.

07:59.470 --> 08:00.470
Ange...

08:01.130 --> 08:03.060
What is it, Dad?

08:03.060 --> 08:05.370
Uh, well...

08:08.530 --> 08:11.130
What's this about the Red Ogre?

08:11.920 --> 08:15.080
I came up with it! It's your title!

08:15.080 --> 08:16.150
Cool, right?

08:16.150 --> 08:17.920
What? Uh...

08:17.920 --> 08:21.630
Does this mean you've 
been spreading that around?

08:22.280 --> 08:25.150
Ange's been telling everyone all about it.

08:25.150 --> 08:27.550
Did you not know?

08:27.550 --> 08:31.400
There isn't anyone in the Orphen 
guild who doesn't know that name.

08:31.780 --> 08:35.480
The father of the Black-Haired Valkyrie,

08:35.480 --> 08:38.920
the powerful ex-adventurer 
Belgrieve the Red Ogre!

08:38.920 --> 08:42.610
Even the S-rank adventurers 
who came out of retirement

08:42.610 --> 08:44.730
and the guild master recognize him.

08:44.730 --> 08:45.900
Ange...

08:49.790 --> 08:51.290
What am I going to do?

08:51.690 --> 08:56.050
What's the matter, Dad? 
Did I do something wrong?

08:56.310 --> 09:01.800
No. I understand that you care for me,

09:01.800 --> 09:06.880
but I haven't done anything 
to earn that kind of glory.

09:07.220 --> 09:10.100
You mean you're not 
as amazing as Ange says?

09:10.100 --> 09:11.570
Don't get the wrong idea!

09:12.020 --> 09:14.050
Dad is super strong.

09:14.050 --> 09:17.530
Didn't I tell you? 
I've never landed a blow on him.

09:17.530 --> 09:20.350
Maybe, but it's been five years...

09:20.350 --> 09:23.550
I don't care whether 
it's been five or ten years.

09:23.550 --> 09:26.870
If you're not satisfied, 
then I'll prove it to you. Dad!

09:26.870 --> 09:28.500
Y-Yes?

09:28.500 --> 09:30.410
Duel me.

09:30.410 --> 09:34.420
But you just got home.

09:35.410 --> 09:37.170
I don't mind.

09:38.310 --> 09:41.180
We finally get to see the skills
 we've heard so much about.

09:41.180 --> 09:44.180
Both Ange and Ms. Sasha praise you highly.

09:45.520 --> 09:50.290
<i>What on earth has been going on
without my knowledge?</i>

10:05.320 --> 10:07.570
Dad, don't hold back.

10:12.150 --> 10:16.680
<i>I'm not sure how I'll fare against an
 active S-rank adventurer, but...</i>

10:41.590 --> 10:45.230
You haven't worked on the
 habits I told you to fix at all.

10:45.230 --> 10:46.250
And...

10:45.620 --> 10:46.470
You hit me.

10:46.470 --> 10:46.990
Huh?

10:48.230 --> 10:50.760
You hit me for real, Dad!

10:51.140 --> 10:54.130
But... you told me not to hold back.

10:54.910 --> 10:56.140
Up.

10:56.540 --> 10:59.440
Come on now. You're seventeen years old.

10:59.440 --> 11:00.670
Up!

11:05.620 --> 11:08.250
You really are the strongest, Dad.

11:08.250 --> 11:09.630
Come on, you...

11:11.100 --> 11:13.340
<i>It wasn't supposed to go like this.</i>

11:13.640 --> 11:16.510
He beat Ange like it was nothing.

11:16.510 --> 11:20.150
I don't believe it. I mean, Ange is...

11:25.540 --> 11:26.690
Right?

11:26.690 --> 11:27.870
Yeah, yeah.

11:28.420 --> 11:31.970
Well, Ane? Isn't my dad super strong?

11:31.970 --> 11:34.700
Yeah, he's incredible. I'm surprised.

11:36.050 --> 11:38.210
See? I knew you could do it, Dad.

11:38.210 --> 11:39.580
You're totally the Red Ogre.

11:40.690 --> 11:42.090
Ange...

11:42.090 --> 11:43.710
What is it, Dad?

11:44.050 --> 11:50.760
I'm glad you love me, but could you 
stop telling everyone about me?

11:51.040 --> 11:54.110
What? But it's true that you're strong.

11:54.110 --> 11:55.550
Even stronger than me.

11:55.550 --> 12:00.780
Regardless, please stop.
I can't say it thrills me.

12:01.840 --> 12:02.770
I see!

12:02.770 --> 12:05.980
They say the skilled hawk 
hides his talons, after all.

12:05.980 --> 12:08.240
Got it. I'll keep your secret.

12:09.790 --> 12:13.780
Being an unknown master is pretty cool, too...

12:19.690 --> 12:21.720
We don't have bathtubs in Turnera,

12:21.720 --> 12:24.870
so we wipe down with hot washcloths.

12:24.870 --> 12:28.410
Should I take everything off?

12:29.310 --> 12:30.970
That feels good!

12:33.980 --> 12:38.550
Try not to forget you're a lady. 
You shouldn't be so eager to strip down.

12:38.550 --> 12:40.280
Come on, Ane. Take it off!

12:40.990 --> 12:43.080
Did you hear that shriek?

12:43.080 --> 12:45.260
You're so pure, Ane!

12:44.500 --> 12:46.240
Shut up, idiots!

12:47.060 --> 12:49.890
I never seem to get any bigger...

12:49.890 --> 12:51.510
Why is that?

12:51.510 --> 12:55.330
It's not like you've got nothing.
 You're just toned.

12:55.330 --> 12:59.000
Yeah, that's right! 
You're slender. I'm jealous.

12:59.590 --> 13:01.990
Are you being sarcastic, you jerks?

13:01.990 --> 13:04.200
Darn you, booby monster!

13:07.820 --> 13:09.220
I feel refreshed.

13:09.220 --> 13:11.910
Yeah. This is pretty all right.

13:11.910 --> 13:17.030
I'm glad. I finally feel like 
I'm back in Turnera.

13:31.380 --> 13:32.970
Are you done yet?

13:35.090 --> 13:36.770
Welcome home, Dad.

13:36.770 --> 13:38.190
It's nice to be back.

13:38.890 --> 13:40.830
Now, let's have dinner.

13:45.110 --> 13:47.920
I doubt it compares to the food in Orphen,

13:47.920 --> 13:49.360
but have as much as you'd like.

13:49.360 --> 13:51.950
Dad's cooking for the 
first time in five years!

13:51.950 --> 13:54.430
What a feast! I'm so happy!

13:55.780 --> 13:57.680
I smell jarlberries.

13:57.680 --> 14:00.720
You love these. So do I.

14:01.140 --> 14:04.070
I guess they might be 
hard to find in Orphen.

14:04.070 --> 14:05.950
I hope you enjoy them.

14:07.070 --> 14:09.510
They've got a unique flavor, 
but they're tasty.

14:09.510 --> 14:10.990
I like them.

14:10.990 --> 14:12.780
Me, too.

14:12.780 --> 14:15.140
I see. I'm glad to hear that.

14:15.140 --> 14:16.710
I haven't had this in ages either.

14:17.450 --> 14:19.340
Ange, what is that?

14:19.710 --> 14:22.200
It's a kind of bird called shiragidori.
 It's delicious.

14:22.200 --> 14:25.670
You do it like this, hold it so it doesn't drip,

14:25.670 --> 14:27.840
and bring the dish to your mouth.

14:29.610 --> 14:31.210
So good!

14:31.210 --> 14:34.690
Huh. Like this, right?

14:35.480 --> 14:37.720
Miri, you got oil on your hat.

14:38.730 --> 14:41.220
Aw, darn. Now I've done it.

14:41.540 --> 14:45.010
Miri, it must be difficult eating like that.

14:45.010 --> 14:46.980
Why don't you take off your hat?

14:46.980 --> 14:50.730
Um, well...

14:53.650 --> 14:56.870
Miri, my dad isn't that kind of person.

14:57.890 --> 15:01.030
I know, but...

15:01.840 --> 15:03.590
Look, a beastfolk.

15:03.590 --> 15:04.640
Are those ears real?

15:04.640 --> 15:07.130
You could probably sell her to a 
freak show for a high price.

15:07.130 --> 15:09.250
Did you see that girl's ears?

15:09.250 --> 15:13.210
Poor thing. She must've had a hard life.

15:14.950 --> 15:18.000
I'm sorry. I didn't mean anything by it.

15:18.000 --> 15:20.650
You don't have to take it off
 if you don't want.

15:35.640 --> 15:38.670
I see. So that's why.

15:42.820 --> 15:44.950
Your ears were cold.

15:45.920 --> 15:50.120
Unlike Orphen, 
the nights get chilly in Turnera.

15:50.120 --> 15:51.170
Huh?

15:51.170 --> 15:54.560
I know! I've got a wool cap 
around here somewhere.

15:54.560 --> 15:58.780
It won't get in your way, 
and it'll keep your ears warm.

15:58.780 --> 16:00.380
It should be over here.

16:01.530 --> 16:03.380
He thinks your ears got cold.

16:04.290 --> 16:05.000
See?

16:07.780 --> 16:12.310
You're right. 
He is your dad, after all, isn't he?

16:13.670 --> 16:15.150
I found it. Here you are.

16:15.150 --> 16:17.120
Huh? What is it?

16:17.980 --> 16:19.960
It's nothing.

16:21.000 --> 16:22.830
U-Um...

16:25.230 --> 16:29.320
Um, would you mind patting me on the head?

16:29.960 --> 16:31.830
Uh, sure.

16:35.630 --> 16:37.090
What is this?!

16:37.560 --> 16:39.090
Is that what you wanted?

16:39.090 --> 16:42.120
Yes, thank you.

16:43.000 --> 16:45.220
So this is what it's like to have a father...

16:45.750 --> 16:47.110
A father?

16:47.920 --> 16:50.120
She can be a bit odd.

16:51.490 --> 16:53.320
You're jealous, aren't you?

16:53.320 --> 16:55.360
I know you are.

16:55.950 --> 17:00.870
N-No, it's not like I want to ride 
on his shoulders or anything.

17:02.880 --> 17:03.990
Guys...

17:04.630 --> 17:10.010
If you wish to ride on my dad's shoulders,
 you must defeat me first!

17:10.490 --> 17:12.300
I'm telling you, it's not like that!

17:25.460 --> 17:27.450
Don't look before you move.

17:27.450 --> 17:29.310
How many times do I have to tell you that?

17:29.310 --> 17:32.100
You should've gotten it by now.

17:32.100 --> 17:34.970
No one besides you has 
ever dodged my attacks.

17:34.970 --> 17:38.150
Can you say for certain you won't 
meet someone who can in the future?

17:38.150 --> 17:41.110
Make all the excuses you want, 
but monsters won't listen.

17:41.420 --> 17:42.520
But...

17:42.520 --> 17:45.360
No buts. Don't get a big head.

17:45.360 --> 17:46.700
Hear me out, Ange.

17:47.130 --> 17:51.200
I'll be worried about you 
if you can't beat me in practice.

17:51.200 --> 17:55.380
You're fighting high-rank beasts
 and Demon Kings.

17:56.420 --> 17:59.010
The Demon King wasn't as strong as you.

17:59.350 --> 18:02.240
Give me a break. That can't be true.

18:03.040 --> 18:05.880
By the way, what <i>was</i> the Demon King like?

18:06.320 --> 18:10.400
Well, it was sort of a moving black shadow.

18:10.400 --> 18:11.810
A shadow?

18:16.910 --> 18:17.940
What'd it look like?

18:17.940 --> 18:22.440
Humanoid, but small like a child.

18:26.450 --> 18:28.330
<i>They must be different creatures.</i>

18:28.870 --> 18:32.160
<i>If that had been a Demon King,
 then we would be...</i>

18:32.160 --> 18:33.150
Dad?

18:34.050 --> 18:35.320
What's the matter?

18:35.320 --> 18:37.070
Ah, nothing.

18:37.070 --> 18:38.900
Hey, you two!

18:39.470 --> 18:42.220
Wanna have lunch?

18:43.370 --> 18:46.950
Okay! Lunchtime, lunchtime...

18:48.040 --> 18:50.210
<i>The Demon King looked like a shadow...</i>

18:50.210 --> 18:55.330
<i>Since she's rank S, Ange will continue 
to fight monsters like that in the future.</i>

18:57.210 --> 18:59.520
<i>She can lose her right leg and survive.</i>

18:59.520 --> 19:02.720
<i>But if she loses her life, it's all over.</i>

19:05.650 --> 19:06.590
Ange.

19:07.090 --> 19:08.250
What is it?

19:08.750 --> 19:12.750
Are you going to continue adventuring?

19:12.750 --> 19:15.490
Yeah. After all, it's fun.

19:15.490 --> 19:17.750
It's probably the best profession for me.

19:23.490 --> 19:24.690
Dad?

19:25.230 --> 19:30.070
If you want to continue adventuring, 
then you must beat me in a duel.

19:31.120 --> 19:31.950
What?

19:32.730 --> 19:37.320
I can't allow you to keep going with
 half-baked resolve and skills.

19:37.720 --> 19:42.060
If you continue adventuring 
without beating me first,

19:42.750 --> 19:45.360
I'll no longer consider you my daughter.

19:54.270 --> 19:58.320
Dad, you're kidding, right?

20:00.660 --> 20:01.950
Pick up your sword.

20:02.620 --> 20:03.700
No.

20:04.270 --> 20:08.030
No, no, no! I don't wanna!

20:08.030 --> 20:10.480
You think monsters will heed your whining?

20:11.860 --> 20:13.060
Pick up your sword!

20:15.340 --> 20:17.730
I don't want to do this.

20:18.320 --> 20:21.440
This isn't like you...

20:21.660 --> 20:22.450
Here we go!

20:26.600 --> 20:29.310
<i>Why? Why, why?</i>

20:29.310 --> 20:32.110
<i>Is it because I made him angry?</i>

20:33.740 --> 20:37.130
<i>No, he's not angry.</i>

20:37.130 --> 20:40.620
<i>He's sad because I'm so pathetic.</i>

20:53.450 --> 20:54.530
<i>She got me!</i>

21:00.090 --> 21:01.300
Ange...

21:01.830 --> 21:05.670
Nicely done. 
I knew you could do it, my girl.

21:05.670 --> 21:07.040
Apologize.

21:07.040 --> 21:07.610
Huh?

21:08.040 --> 21:10.550
Apologize for being so mean to me!

21:10.550 --> 21:14.910
Don't say you'll disown me! I hate it!

21:14.910 --> 21:18.880
No matter what happens, 
I'll always be your daughter!

21:18.880 --> 21:24.130
O-Okay, I'm sorry. 
I just wanted you to take this seriously.

21:24.130 --> 21:26.000
No! I don't forgive you.

21:26.000 --> 21:28.100
If you want me to, then pick me up.

21:28.100 --> 21:29.360
Squeeze me!

21:30.740 --> 21:32.350
You win.

21:32.730 --> 21:35.780
Good. I was worried for a moment there.

21:35.780 --> 21:39.620
I know. It just feels right 
when those two get along.

21:39.620 --> 21:44.860
But he really <i>is</i> the Reg Ogre after all.

21:46.030 --> 21:46.990
Yeah.

21:51.130 --> 21:53.860
